abstract: "Replication code and derived datasets for the paper testing whether matrilineal Minangkabau and patrilineal Bataknese households in Indonesia configure translocal migration into distinct strategy types, using the Indonesian Family Life Survey wave 5 (IFLS-5, 2014; n = 6,936 ethnic-modal households). Version 1.1 adds gender-disaggregated migration deployment breakdown (Table 1b) and baseline ethnic-disaggregated descriptives (Table 1a)."
